        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 42-630, Hygienic Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Hygienic germ free, hands free design 8-1/8\" long door pull is made from 3/8\" thick solid stainless steel. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school and restaurant  doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-42-630_size.gif?v=1704354718\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 42 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHygienic hands free design - Door can be opened with the forearm.  Great for commercial restroom doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 42-630 Stainless Steel Hygienic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1/4-20 Thrubolt Screws</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/42-630.pdf?v=1704262301\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 42-630 Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
